<title>USA: Markel says stock begins trading on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Markel says stock begins trading on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Markel Corp on Wednesday said its common stock began trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>There are about 5.5 million common shares outstanding, the company said.</p>
<p>Markel's stock previously traded on the Nasdaq National Market System.</p>
<p>Markel markets and underwrites specialty insurance products and programs.</p>
</text>
